---
// Labelled treatment-head diagram plus the three-step routine.
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="container split split--top">
    <div class="stack-lg">
      <h2 class="h2" id="how-title">How it works</h2>
      <p class="measure">Two technologies work on the same spot at the same time, from one small head.</p>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li><h3>Low-level laser</h3><p>A 670 nm red laser in the center of the head, under 1 mW. It doesn’t heat the skin.</p></li>
        <li><h3>TENS electrical stimulation</h3><p>Mild electrical stimulation through two stainless steel contacts, one on each side of the laser.</p></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="diagram">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="diag-t">
          <title id="diag-t">The treatment head: a 670 nm low-level laser in the center and two TENS contacts on either side</title>
          <rect x="70" y="80" width="260" height="100" rx="50" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f2d5c" stroke-width="2" />
          <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="24" fill="#c9d0de" /><circle cx="270" cy="130" r="24" fill="#c9d0de" />
          <circle cx="200" cy="130" r="18" fill="#1f2d5c" />
          <line x1="200" y1="112" x2="200" y2="48" stroke="#1f2d5c" stroke-width="2" />
          <text x="200" y="36" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Atkinson Hyperlegible Next, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#1f2d5c">670 nm low-level laser</text>
          <line x1="130" y1="154" x2="130" y2="214" stroke="#1f2d5c" stroke-width="2" /><line x1="270" y1="154" x2="270" y2="214" stroke="#1f2d5c" stroke-width="2" /><line x1="130" y1="214" x2="270" y2="214" stroke="#1f2d5c" stroke-width="2" />
          <text x="200" y="244" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Atkinson Hyperlegible Next, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#1f2d5c">Two TENS contacts</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stack-lg">
      <h3 class="h3">The routine</h3>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><div><h3>Apply a little gel</h3><p>Put a small amount of electrode gel on the skin over the area.</p></div></li>
        <li><div><h3>About two minutes of slow circles</h3><p>Switch it on and move the head in slow circles over the area for about two minutes.</p></div></li>
        <li><div><h3>Up to five times a day per area</h3><p>As the user manual describes. Wipe the gel off the head and your skin when you’re done.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      {!compact && <p><a href="/how-it-works">More about how it works and safety</a></p>}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
